  "source_limits": [
    "One two-row block is read after a 90° clockwise rotation. Both complete original faces and all margins plus six enlarged/rotated Picture contexts were viewed privately. Printed poem, image and separate ordinary date writing are excluded from ciphertext. No additional continuous cipher run recognized on the visible Address face; a bounded negative observation only.",
    "All source strings, tags, geometry, key and decoder output are unchanged: two rows, 28 selected notation slots/28 known emitted letters/zero CH/zero unknowns. No substantive language repair. Upper-loop/long-stem f, h/r, b/p, d/t, 1/4 and c/s alternatives remain; the thick initial retrace is not counted as a proven second body. Physical body count remains null. Zero masks does not certify source accuracy or completeness.",
    "The source form PEPOUS remains an unverified signature. Ordinary accents and grammatical English word order belong to editorial interpretation; no author identity, full personal name or shared authorship inferred. The separate visual date candidate 6./V.1901. is preserved from both native records without calendar/postmark authentication or encoded-date conversion.",
    "The original first_raw/first_record and blind_raw/blind_record metadata schemas, native rows, original FILE hashes, source-only protocol claims, initial reconciliation and QA17 remain unchanged. Wrapper metadata and separately preserved raw objects retain distinct hash scopes. Four native strict rows/eight inline object hashes and fourteen native ledger references checked. Original raw/strict FILE bytes not reread.",
    "QA17 keeps the one mechanical/span/locator defect on FIRST 315, zero strict-replay/source-tag/schema errors and two separate paired formal preflight timing exceptions. Per-card preflights and both-raw-before-own-decode core barriers passed. The date supplement corrects four to six reading entries, not six physical dates. The target 317 finding remains contour-and-ordinary-date limits; no blanket zero-error or newly repaired incident claim.",
    "This source/key/literal/language-visible same-root AI-assisted review is nonblind and not external confirmation. Eugen Antal’s manual review of 320/321 does not cover 317. Both fresh anonymous GET200 originals match their pinned hashes with no redirect/retry. Other candidates, transmitted register, expert-review package and dated receipts remain unchanged."
